  "notes": "Genting Plantations Berhad — diversified palm oil + property + biotech (palm tissue culture). ~204,000 ha (~504,000 acres) planted in Malaysia and Indonesia. Calendar fiscal year (Dec 31). Quarterly data from Bursa Malaysia Form 8 quarterly results announcements; annual data from 2020-2024 annual reports. Three reportable segments per IFRS 8: Plantation (FFB, CPO, PK), Property (Genting Indahpura, Genting Premium Outlets development), and Biotech (palm tissue culture / R&D). Acres = planted ha × 2.47 / 1000. Net debt = total borrowings − cash & deposits. Property book includes plantation development expenditure + property under development. Some quarterly EBITDA approximated from PBT + finance costs + D&A. Pre-2020 annual data compiled from Genting Plantations 10-year financial highlights tables (FY1995-FY2019) on the IR site, supplemented by historical annual reports filed with Bursa Malaysia. Renamed from Asiatic Development to Genting Plantations in Sep 2009. Indonesia plantations (Kalimantan, Sumatra) acquired progressively starting 2005 — pre-2005 acreage is Malaysia-only (~50-80k ha). Property segment material from FY2008 (Indahpura development); biotech immaterial in scope (~RM10M revenue). Earliest years had no biotech segment.",
